  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31894926",
      "title": "Scheduling Notifications",
      "lectureOrder": 246,
      "videoOrder": 239,
      "sourceHash": "d752802b608e824d0b86d642e9c9bfe89e3821e865bf5bf8def735eb819446fe",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.349,
          "end": 2.83,
          "en": "So let's get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.83,
          "end": 5.67,
          "en": "with local notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.67,
          "end": 8.05,
          "en": "For this, I'm back in this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.05,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "in this starting project I set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.83,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "And I will stay in App.js for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 15.74,
          "en": "because we're not going to build a fancy app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.74,
          "end": 17.41,
          "en": "Instead, we're just going to focus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.41,
          "end": 20.15,
          "en": "on these core and notification features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.15,
          "end": 21.85,
          "en": "so that you can learn about those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.85,
          "end": 24.273,
          "en": "without having to build a complete app again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.33,
          "end": 27.35,
          "en": "So therefore here, I actually wanna start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.35,
          "end": 31.32,
          "en": "by showing a Button which when pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.32,
          "end": 35.499,
          "en": "should actually schedule such notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.499,
          "end": 39.88,
          "en": "So for this, I'll import Button from react-native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.88,
          "end": 44.263,
          "en": "and add a Button here where I say Schedule Notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 47.42,
          "en": "And then the goal is to do just that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.42,
          "end": 50.84,
          "en": "to schedule a local notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.84,
          "end": 53.63,
          "en": "Therefore, in this App component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.63,
          "end": 55.838,
          "en": "I will add a nested function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.838,
          "end": 58.088,
          "en": "scheduleNotificationHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.23,
          "end": 61.223,
          "en": "could be the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 64.87,
          "en": "And on this Button, I will add the onPress prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.87,
          "end": 67.09,
          "en": "to point at the scheduleNotificationHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.47,
          "end": 70.773,
          "en": "so that this function will be triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.91,
          "end": 74.35,
          "en": "And now to schedule a notification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.35,
          "end": 78.28999999999999,
          "en": "we have to import everything as Notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.28999999999999,
          "end": 81.283,
          "en": "from expo-notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 85.97,
          "en": "That's also what you find in the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.97,
          "end": 87.51,
          "en": "That is how you get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.51,
          "end": 91.85300000000001,
          "en": "to the various methods exposed by this package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.74000000000001,
          "end": 95.67,
          "en": "So with that, we import this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.67,
          "end": 97.773,
          "en": "And now here in scheduleNotificationHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 101.49000000000001,
          "en": "we can use this Notifications object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.49000000000001,
          "end": 103.52000000000001,
          "en": "which we are building here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.52000000000001,
          "end": 108.52000000000001,
          "en": "to then call the scheduleNotificationAsync method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.84,
          "end": 113.11,
          "en": "And this will schedule a local notification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.11,
          "end": 114.53999999999999,
          "en": "and async simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.53999999999999,
          "end": 116.793,
          "en": "that this returns a promise in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.72999999999999,
          "end": 119.15,
          "en": "Now, this method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.15,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "which we're calling scheduleNotificationAsync",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 126.848,
          "en": "wants an object where we configure this notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.848,
          "end": 130.15,
          "en": "It's an object that takes various properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.15,
          "end": 133.48,
          "en": "To be precise, it takes a trigger property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.48,
          "end": 138.001,
          "en": "an identifier property, and a content property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.001,
          "end": 140.56,
          "en": "Now, as always, you can learn more about that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.56,
          "end": 142.79,
          "en": "in the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.79,
          "end": 144.51,
          "en": "There, if you search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.51,
          "end": 149.51,
          "en": "for this scheduleNotificationAsync method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.82999999999998,
          "end": 154.36,
          "en": "you'll learn more about the configuration at once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.36,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "and you'll learn how do you trigger,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 158.493,
          "en": "and the content can be configured, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.63,
          "end": 162.17000000000002,
          "en": "You can also dive into the full type definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.17000000000002,
          "end": 163.84,
          "en": "of this request object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.84,
          "end": 166.9,
          "en": "to learn about all the possible settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.9,
          "end": 169.54,
          "en": "that can be set up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.54,
          "end": 170.82999999999998,
          "en": "So here what I'll do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.82999999999998,
          "end": 175.17000000000002,
          "en": "is I'll add a content key which, again, wants object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "and now here, again, we can configure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 179.996,
          "en": "the content of this notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.996,
          "end": 183.38,
          "en": "Now, as you see, there are a lot of properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.38,
          "end": 185.67,
          "en": "that can be set for the content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.67,
          "end": 188.08,
          "en": "Again, you can learn all about that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.08,
          "end": 189.673,
          "en": "in the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.52,
          "end": 192.62,
          "en": "I wanna highlight, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.62,
          "end": 196.5,
          "en": "that some of these settings will only work on Android",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.5,
          "end": 198.803,
          "en": "and some settings might only work on iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.803,
          "end": 203.273,
          "en": "What can always be set, though, is the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.18,
          "end": 206.54,
          "en": "And here I wanna set the title to a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.54,
          "end": 208.32,
          "en": "and you should set it to a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.32,
          "end": 212.22,
          "en": "which sets the title that will show up in the notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.22,
          "end": 214.363,
          "en": "when it is received on the device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.551,
          "end": 219.28300000000002,
          "en": "So here I'll say My first local notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.603,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "In addition, after setting the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 227.92000000000002,
          "en": "I'll also set the body which also wants a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.92000000000002,
          "end": 231.06,
          "en": "and here the string can be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 235.36,
          "en": "to This is the body of the notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.36,
          "end": 238.07,
          "en": "So that will essentially be the detail text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.07,
          "end": 241.603,
          "en": "that shows up inside of the received notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.6,
          "end": 244.31,
          "en": "We can also add some extra data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.31,
          "end": 247.61,
          "en": "which will not be visible when the notification opens up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.61,
          "end": 249.14,
          "en": "but which can be extracted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.14,
          "end": 251.703,
          "en": "when we then handle the notification in code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.68,
          "end": 254.33,
          "en": "In here, you can set an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.33,
          "end": 256.84,
          "en": "with any key-value pairs of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.84,
          "end": 261.65,
          "en": "For example, userName: Max.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.65,
          "end": 263.43,
          "en": "And we will be able to extract this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.43,
          "end": 266.713,
          "en": "when we then later handle the incoming notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.002,
          "end": 272.32,
          "en": "Now, besides that, there are more properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.32,
          "end": 273.53,
          "en": "that could be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.53,
          "end": 275.45,
          "en": "You could, for example, again, set a sound",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.45,
          "end": 277.95,
          "en": "that should be played for this notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.95,
          "end": 279.25,
          "en": "when it's received,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.25,
          "end": 281.5,
          "en": "a priority which is handled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 281.5,
          "end": 283.5,
          "en": "or which is respected by the device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.5,
          "end": 287.58,
          "en": "to tell the device how the notification should be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 287.58,
          "end": 289.45,
          "en": "and how it should be prioritized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.45,
          "end": 293.31,
          "en": "compared with other notifications that might be scheduled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.31,
          "end": 294.97,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.97,
          "end": 296.26,
          "en": "The best idea always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.26,
          "end": 299.4,
          "en": "is to also play around with these various properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 299.4,
          "end": 301.273,
          "en": "to get a feeling for what they do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 302.32,
          "end": 304.69,
          "en": "Now, that's my content here, however.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.69,
          "end": 307.233,
          "en": "As a next step, we have to set a trigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.19,
          "end": 310.2,
          "en": "Trigger also takes an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.2,
          "end": 313.18,
          "en": "and in this object, you basically configure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 313.18,
          "end": 316.36,
          "en": "when this notification should be delivered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.36,
          "end": 318.69,
          "en": "And what you should set on this trigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 318.69,
          "end": 321.11,
          "en": "is actually the seconds property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 321.11,
          "end": 323.23,
          "en": "which configures the number of seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 323.23,
          "end": 325.763,
          "en": "until this notification will be delivered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.72,
          "end": 328.37,
          "en": "And here I'll set this to five",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 328.37,
          "end": 330.58299999999997,
          "en": "so that we don't have to wait too long.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.839,
          "end": 334.36,
          "en": "Now, with these all configured,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 334.36,
          "end": 337.13,
          "en": "if we now go back to our applications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 337.13,
          "end": 342.13,
          "en": "we give this a try on Android and we wait for five seconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 343.47,
          "end": 348,
          "en": "then we will note that nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348,
          "end": 350.06,
          "en": "We can sit here forever and wait,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.06,
          "end": 353.05,
          "en": "but we don't get any notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 353.05,
          "end": 355.84000000000003,
          "en": "No notification is received here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.84000000000003,
          "end": 360.38,
          "en": "Well, actually, it is received, it's just not displayed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 360.38,
          "end": 363.713,
          "en": "and that's therefore what we'll take care of next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
